<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong></p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> SCP-XXXX is a anomaly that represents the lost of ww1 and is hostile due to the amount of death in the First World War.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> On [REDACTED] reports reached the foundation of a figure of a WW1 German soldier appear around the trenches attacking humans if humans are near.MTF-93 was dispatched to see what it was and they were attacked but took SCP-XXXX into custody.SCP-XXXX has a gas mask for a face but eyes have been identified.It carried a G98(Confiscated) and has attempted to escape containment with attempts a failure.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> Readers to remember veterans</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong>SCP-XXXX has revealed the truth about ghost soldiers in WW1.It claims that those are SCPs as well.When asked where it originated it replied with Ypres.It has revealed also that it fought in SCP-186.SCP-XXXX decided to cooperate when it was allowed to visit a war cemetery on [REDACTED] but visitors were not allowed and 8 armed agents accompanied it.SCP-XXXX has written what it knows about the First World War.The document is under exploration.</p>

